## Example

```json
{
  "node_type": "transform",
  "properties": {
    "variables": [
      {
        "key": "greeting",
        "value_lang": "handlebars",
        "value": "Hello \{{$recipient.name}}, welcome!"
      },
      {
        "key": "discount_rate",
        "value_lang": "jsonnet",
        "value": "if data[\"$recipient\"].monthly_spend > 1000 then 15 else 10"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
